{"4037650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unknown Fluffy Object", "steam_appid": 4037650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Unknown Fluffy Object,</strong> you play as Buddy, a loyal sheepdog tasked with rescuing your flock from mysterious UFOs haunting the Scottish hills. Each sheep has wandered far and wide, and it’s up to you to guide them home safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/a2c056f6a1d7ad70c59e849d030926ae.poster.avif?t=1762213713\" width=900 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/a2c056f6a1d7ad70c59e849d030926ae.webm?t=1762213713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/a2c056f6a1d7ad70c59e849d030926ae.mp4?t=1762213713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Buddy’s movement and powerful bark to overcome natural obstacles and outwit alien patrols. Herd your sheep across rushing rivers, along narrow cliff paths, and through fields buzzing with UFO activity. Every level challenges your puzzle-solving skills, reflexes, and strategy as you balance protecting your flock with keeping them moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/f6b53c62e8d99a25313bcbba2923c8e5.poster.avif?t=1762213713\" width=900 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/f6b53c62e8d99a25313bcbba2923c8e5.webm?t=1762213713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/f6b53c62e8d99a25313bcbba2923c8e5.mp4?t=1762213713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outsmart the UFOs’ baa-d schemes and bring every last sheep back to the pasture?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Unknown Fluffy Object,</strong> you play as Buddy, a loyal sheepdog tasked with rescuing your flock from mysterious UFOs haunting the Scottish hills. Each sheep has wandered far and wide, and it’s up to you to guide them home safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/a2c056f6a1d7ad70c59e849d030926ae.poster.avif?t=1762213713\" width=900 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/a2c056f6a1d7ad70c59e849d030926ae.webm?t=1762213713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037650/extras/a2c056f6a1d7ad70c59e849d030926ae.mp4?t=1762213713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Buddy’s movement and powerful bark to overcome natural obstacles and outwit alien patrols. Herd your sheep across rushing rivers, along narrow cliff paths, and through fields buzzing with UFO activity. Every level challenges your puzzle-solving skills, reflexes, and strategy as you balance protecting your flock with keeping them moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr